            },
            "content": [
              {
                "attrs": {
                  "dir": "auto"
                },
                "content": [
                  {
                    "text": "User Types:",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              },
              {
                "attrs": {
                  "dir": "auto"
                },
                "type": "paragraph"
              },
              {
                "attrs": {
                  "dir": "auto"
                },
                "content": [
                  {
                    "text": "Sophisticated - devs, engineers, IT departments, personnel knowledgable about secrets, their handling, and their relevance. They understand the risks associated with mismanagement of creds. ",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              },
              {
                "attrs": {
                  "dir": "auto"
                },
                "content": [
                  {
                    "text": "Goal: maximize security while minimizing friction",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              },
              {
                "attrs": {
                  "dir": "auto"
                },
                "content": [
                  {
                    "text": "Positives: they already understand the root goal of the practice, and as long as the friction point is lower than manual management, they will be ok with it. ",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              },
              {
                "attrs": {
                  "dir": "auto"
                },
                "content": [
                  {
                    "text": "Negatives: they may be highly opinionated about how, when, and where the scans occurs logically",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              },
              {
                "attrs": {
                  "dir": "auto"
                },
                "type": "paragraph"
              },
              {
                "attrs": {
                  "dir": "auto"
                },
                "type": "paragraph"
              },
              {
                "attrs": {
                  "dir": "auto"
                },
                "content": [
                  {
                    "text": "Unsophisticated - little to no knowledge of secrets, their usage, or why it matters to keep them secrets. ie, new AI users self building a piece of software for their small business",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              },
              {
                "attrs": {
                  "dir": "auto"
                },
                "content": [
                  {
                    "text": "Goal: they want to create their tool with as little friction as possible",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              },
              {
                "attrs": {
                  "dir": "auto"
                },
                "content": [
                  {
                    "text": "Positives: they only care about the ease of its use, not the technicals",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              },
              {
                "attrs": {
                  "dir": "auto"
                },
                "content": [
                  {
                    "text": "Negatives: they may not understand the importance of this type of security. Adoption will depend on the product making the importance relevant to them, and the friction point extremely low. ",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ],
                "type": "paragraph"
              }
            ],
            "type": "doc"
